// Ecat_9_1_432                This is most excellent, Wilhem. Our alliance with the Cappadocians shall strengthen when I reveal Mercurio’s treachery to Garinol. Wilhem, thou art a Brujah of surpassing splendor! Our Grandsire Brujah himself would feel pride at this.

